 "text": "Hi, how are you? Not at all. dressed for work means dressed like you're going in, not like you're lounging. A dress shirt, nice pants, even a tie. Shoes are crucial. Not really. A pair of flats with good grip is the norm, and if you' lucky enough to have a desk with a leg on the floor, shoes without heels are even better. Exactly. And one last thing, no sandals or Crocs. If you can't wear them in the office, don't wear them at home.",
